@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Registro público (no requiere JWT)
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Diego",
  "email": "diego@example.com",
  "password": "Diego123!",
  "age": 22
}

### Iniciar sesión con el usuario registrado
# @name registeredLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "diego@example.com",
  "password": "Diego123!"
}

### Obtener un JWT con el correo y contraseña de un usuario
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Alice123!"
}

### Listar usuarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Consultar un usuario
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Datos inválidos: devuelve 400 con detalles
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": " ",
  "email": "correo-invalido",
  "age": -1
}

### Eliminar un usuario
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{register.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Sin JWT: devuelve 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
